#: fc-savings-calculator.php:1655
msgid "AC Savings Calculator Plugin"
msgstr "AC Calculadora de Ahorros Plugin"

#. Plugin Name of the plugin/theme
msgid "AC Savings Calculator"
msgstr "AC Calculadora de Ahorros"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin/theme. Do not translate the URL.
msgid "https://AccurateCalculators.com/calculator-plugins/savings-plus-plugin"
msgstr "https://AccurateCalculators.com/calculator-plugins/savings-plus-plugin"

#. Description of the plugin/theme
msgid "A responsive savings calculator with date-based savings schedule and charts. Rebrand with your name. Supports 90 currencies, 6 date formats, and 15 languages. Highly customizable via extensive configuration options. Version 2.0 is a major update—test before upgrading."
msgstr "Una calculadora de ahorros adaptable con calendario de ahorros basado en fechas y gráficos. Rebrande con su nombre. Soporta 90 monedas, 6 formatos de fecha y 15 idiomas. Altamente personalizable a través de amplias opciones de configuración. La versión 2.0 es una actualización importante: pruebe antes de actualizar."

#. Author of the plugin/theme Do not translate the domain.
msgid "AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "AccurateCalculators.com"

#. Author URI of the plugin/theme. Do not translate the URL.
msgid "https://AccurateCalculators.com"
msgstr "https://AccurateCalculators.com"

